# request-and-response-combined.tflw — CHECK-ONLY FIXTURE (M49, PLAN_WEBV2_M45.md): a `request
# connects`/`fails` assertion combined with a response-based assertion on the same request —
# demonstrates `tflw check`'s teaching diagnostic (TF031: checker).
#
# Run explicitly (dot-directory, invalid syntax — see bad-keyword.tflw's header for why):
#   npx tflw check tests/.checkonly/request-and-response-combined.tflw

test "request connects combined with a response assertion on the same request"
  api GET /health
  expect request connects
  expect status equals 200
